// An array as a value, one past the end, n-ary, long arithmetic: `x = (c - a) * 2000000000 * 2 / 1000`. KIELER runs
// it: x is 0, 8000000, 8000000.
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A do x = (c - a) * 2000000000 * 2 / 1000 go to A }
